###Mapping
Mapping test::ivoryprairie::mapping::PrairieMapping
(
  *test::ivoryprairie::domain::Meadow[meadow]: Relational
  {
    ~primaryKey
    (
      [test::ivoryprairie::store::PrairieDB]prairie.meadow.meadow_id
    )
    ~mainTable [test::ivoryprairie::store::PrairieDB]prairie.meadow
    name: [test::ivoryprairie::store::PrairieDB]prairie.meadow.meadow_name,
    wildflowerCount: [test::ivoryprairie::store::PrairieDB]prairie.meadow.wildflower_count
  }
)
